{"seq":2,"slug":"selected-works-of-deng","title":"邓小平文选","stage":"DONE","category":"deng-xiaoping-theory","categoryLabel":"邓小平理论","chapterCount":3,"docCount":9,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/selected-works-of-deng","rating":{"composite":3.82,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4.67,"strategic":3.5},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/leaders/02_deng-xiaoping-theory/02_selected-works-of-deng","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"邓小平文选-简介\">邓小平文选 简介</h1><p>《邓小平文选》是邓小平不同历史时期重要著作、讲话和谈话的权威汇编，共三卷。本知识库不是邓小平理论的&quot;专题论述&quot;，而是<strong>以原著文本为中心的逐卷导读</strong>——它的定位是带读者回到第一手文献，理解每一篇文章&quot;写于何时、针对何事、提出了什么、为何重要&quot;，而把成体系的专题展开交给同一 hub 群里的其它专题 hub。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-与兄弟-hub-的分工边界\">本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工边界</h2><p>邓小平理论 hub 群（<code>leaders/02_deng-xiaoping-theory/</code>）按&quot;文本 / 总览 / 专题&quot;三层组织。本 hub 处在&quot;文本&quot;层，是其它所有专题 hub 的史料底座。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Hub</th>\n<th>切入角度</th>\n<th>适合什么时候读</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>本 hub·邓小平文选</strong></td>\n<td>原著文本，逐卷逐篇</td>\n<td>想读原文、追踪文献出处与历史语境时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../deng-xiaoping-thought-overview/\">邓小平思想总览</a></td>\n<td>人物 + 概念地图</td>\n<td>第一次接触，需要全局框架时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../reform-and-opening-up/\">改革开放</a></td>\n<td>政策史专题</td>\n<td>想了解农村改革、特区、对外开放的来龙去脉</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../socialism-with-chinese-characteristics/\">中国特色社会主义</a></td>\n<td>理论命题专题</td>\n<td>钻研本质论、初级阶段理论</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../southern-tour-talks/\">南方谈话</a></td>\n<td>单一事件专题</td>\n<td>深挖 1992 年南巡的背景与影响</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../one-country-two-systems/\">一国两制</a></td>\n<td>统一方针专题</td>\n<td>研究港澳台框架</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../socialist-market-economy-theory/\">社会主义市场经济理论</a></td>\n<td>经济体制专题</td>\n<td>研究计划/市场之争与体制建构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../deng-xiaoping-methodology/\">邓小平方法论</a></td>\n<td>思维方法专题</td>\n<td>提炼实事求是、摸石头过河等方法论</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../deng-foreign-policy/\">邓小平外交</a></td>\n<td>对外战略专题</td>\n<td>研究韬光养晦、中美/中日关系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../deng-xiaoping-legacy/\">邓小平的历史遗产</a></td>\n<td>评价与比较</td>\n<td>做历史定位、人物比较</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话区分：<strong>专题 hub 回答&quot;是什么、为什么&quot;，本 hub 回答&quot;原文在哪、原话怎么说&quot;。</strong> 遇到专题 hub 中引用的论断，可回本 hub 查证文本出处与上下文。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三卷结构\">三卷结构</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>卷</th>\n<th>时间跨度</th>\n<th>历史定位</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"volume-one/vol1-overview\">第一卷</a></td>\n<td>1938-1965</td>\n<td>思想方法的萌芽期：根据地建设、党的建设、社会主义建设初探</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"volume-two/vol2-overview\">第二卷</a></td>\n<td>1975-1982</td>\n<td>改革开放的奠基期：拨乱反正、解放思想、中国特色社会主义命题提出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"volume-three/vol3-overview\">第三卷</a></td>\n<td>1982-1992</td>\n<td>理论的成熟期：一国两制、市场经济论、南巡讲话</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>每卷下设三篇：<strong>概述</strong>（时代脉络与结构）、<strong>重要篇目解读</strong>（精读代表文献）、<strong>核心主题分析</strong>（提炼贯穿主题）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径-分人群\">推荐学习路径（分人群）</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>初学者 / 通识读者</strong>：先读 <a href=\"../deng-xiaoping-thought-overview/\">邓小平思想总览</a> 建立框架，再回到本 hub 按&quot;第二卷 → 第三卷 → 第一卷&quot;顺序读三篇<strong>概述</strong>即可，暂不必深究单篇文献。先读第二卷是因为它是转折关键、最易切入。</li>\n<li><strong>党史 / 政治理论学习者</strong>：按&quot;概述 → 核心主题分析 → 重要篇目解读&quot;的顺序逐卷推进，三卷读完后横向对读三篇<strong>核心主题分析</strong>，把握同一主题在三卷中的演进轨迹。</li>\n<li><strong>研究者 / 需要引证原文者</strong>：以本 hub 的<strong>重要篇目解读</strong>为索引，定位到《解放思想，实事求是》《党和国家领导制度的改革》《一个国家，两种制度》、南巡讲话等关键文本，再回到原著精读，并交叉参阅对应专题 hub。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>历史背景</strong>：对抗日战争、解放战争、&quot;文化大革命&quot;、十一届三中全会、苏东剧变等关键节点有基本了解，否则文献的语境难以把握。</li>\n<li><strong>理论基础</strong>：理解马克思主义的基本范畴——尤其是 <a href=\"../../../marxism/marxism-fundamentals/epistemology-methodology/practice-cognition\">实践与认识</a>、<a href=\"../../../marxism/marxism-fundamentals/historical-materialism/productive-forces-relations\">生产力与生产关系</a> 与 <a href=\"../../../marxism/marxism-fundamentals/marxism-history/marxism-china\">马克思主义在中国</a>，是读懂邓小平论述深层逻辑的钥匙。</li>\n<li><strong>阅读方法</strong>：每读一篇，先还原写作的历史背景，再细读原文，最后提炼方法论启示——这是研读邓小平著作最有效的三步法。</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"volume-one","title":"第一卷","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/selected-works-of-deng/volume-one","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"vol1-overview","title":"《邓小平文选》第一卷概述","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/selected-works-of-deng/volume-one/vol1-overview"},{"seq":2,"slug":"key-articles-vol1","title":"第一卷重要篇目解读","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/selected-works-of-deng/volume-one/key-articles-vol1"},{"seq":3,"slug":"vol1-themes","title":"第一卷核心主题分析","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/selected-works-of-deng/volume-one/vol1-themes"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"volume-two","title":"第二卷","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/selected-works-of-deng/volume-two","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"vol2-overview","title":"《邓小平文选》第二卷概述","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/selected-works-of-deng/volume-two/vol2-overview"},{"seq":2,"slug":"key-articles-vol2","title":"第二卷重要篇目解读","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/selected-works-of-deng/volume-two/key-articles-vol2"},{"seq":3,"slug":"vol2-themes","title":"第二卷核心主题分析","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/selected-works-of-deng/volume-two/vol2-themes"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"volume-three","title":"第三卷","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/selected-works-of-deng/volume-three","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"vol3-overview","title":"《邓小平文选》第三卷概述","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/selected-works-of-deng/volume-three/vol3-overview"},{"seq":2,"slug":"key-articles-vol3","title":"第三卷重要篇目解读","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/selected-works-of-deng/volume-three/key-articles-vol3"},{"seq":3,"slug":"vol3-themes","title":"第三卷核心主题分析","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/selected-works-of-deng/volume-three/vol3-themes"}]}]}